{
    "chapter_num": 3,
    "verses_count": 19,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Son Was Faithful"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, holy brethren, partakers of the heavenly calling, consider the Apostle and High Priest of our confession, Christ Jesus, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who was faithful to Him who appointed Him, as Moses also "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was faithful"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in all His house. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For this One has been counted worthy of more glory than Moses, inasmuch as He who built the house has more honor than the house. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For every house is built by someone, but He who built all things "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Moses indeed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " faithful in all His house as a servant, for a testimony of those things which would be spoken "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "afterward,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but Christ as a Son over His own house, whose house we are if we hold fast the confidence and the rejoicing of the hope "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits firm to the end"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "firm to the end."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Be Faithful"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, as the Holy Spirit says:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Today, if you will hear His voice,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Do not harden your hearts as in the rebellion,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "In the day of trial in the wilderness,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Where your fathers tested Me, tried Me,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And saw My works forty years."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Therefore I was angry with that generation,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And said, ‘They always go astray in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "their"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "heart,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And they have not known My ways.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "So I swore in My wrath,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "‘They shall not enter My rest.’ ”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beware, brethren, lest there be in any of you an evil heart of unbelief in departing from the living God; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "encourage"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "exhort one another daily, while it is called "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Today,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " lest any of you be hardened through the deceitfulness of sin. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we have become partakers of Christ if we hold the beginning of our confidence steadfast to the end, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "while it is said:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Today, if you will hear His voice,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Do not harden your hearts as in the rebellion.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Failure of the Wilderness Wanderers"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For who, having heard, rebelled? Indeed, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not all who came out of Egypt, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "led"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " by Moses? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now with whom was He angry forty years? "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Was it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not with those who sinned, whose corpses fell in the wilderness? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And to whom did He swear that they would not enter His rest, but to those who did not obey? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So we see that they could not enter in because of unbelief."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}